 3 │ When starting a new venture, especially with limited resources, selecting the right database can significantly impact your project’s success. For a two-person startup, deciding between PostgreSQL and MySQL is crucial as it affects both technical and operational aspects of the business. This blog post aims to provide an in-depth comparison based on specific features and operational tradeoffs that drove our decision.
