 7 │ Our startup is focused on building a web application that requires robust data management capabilities but operates with limited financial resources. We need a database system that not only meets our current needs but also scales well as we grow. After careful consideration, we decided to choose PostgreSQL over MySQL. In this post, I'll outline the key features and tradeoffs that led us to make this choice.
