 66 │ 
 67 │ After carefully weighing the pros and cons, we chose PostgreSQL for our two-person startup’s first production database. The combination of advanced features, robust data integrity, superior performance in complex query operations, and no licensing fees made it an ideal choice. However, every project is unique, and your decision should be based on your specific needs and constraints.
    · ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
